  "description": "The phrase 'hard to argue with a woman that's braless' is a misogynistic trope that suggests a woman's physical appearance (specifically, being braless) gives her an unfair advantage in arguments. This is a form of gender-based bias that equates physical attractiveness with intellectual superiority.",
